    "detailed_description": "Abstracto is a Retro-Inspired, Hack N' Slash, Combat-Oriented Platformer, with a deep combat system that lets you play your way. Play as Forte a blue square on a quest to defeat the evil Immotus and save the strange land of the Abstract. Armed with a powerful sword from his creator the Structor, Forte must fight through the dilapidated Abstract and gain new stones to power up his sword. On the way Forte will need to learn to fight the various creatures of the abstract and make peace with some others. Master the combat systems of Abstracto to perform some long satisfying combos and link into powerful attacks.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Defeat enemies to gain &quot;Materia&quot;.<br />\r\n*Use &quot;Materia&quot; to buy new attacks and abilities.<br />\r\n*Combo enemies until they break to increase &quot;Materia&quot; gained.<br />\r\n*Defeat bosses to get stones to use in your sword.<br />\r\n*Swap stones mid-combo to suit your needs.<br />\r\n*Release the attack button just before an attack comes out to enhance your attacks.<br />\r\n*Block attacks as they hit to Parry. Parrying negates all damage and even reflects projectiles.<br />\r\n*Feeling overwhelmed? Cancel your attacks with a well timed parry.<br />\r\n*3 Unlockable characters<br />\r\n*80 Levels<br />\r\n*4 Difficulties",
    "about_the_game": "Abstracto is a Retro-Inspired, Hack N' Slash, Combat-Oriented Platformer, with a deep combat system that lets you play your way. Play as Forte a blue square on a quest to defeat the evil Immotus and save the strange land of the Abstract. Armed with a powerful sword from his creator the Structor, Forte must fight through the dilapidated Abstract and gain new stones to power up his sword. On the way Forte will need to learn to fight the various creatures of the abstract and make peace with some others. Master the combat systems of Abstracto to perform some long satisfying combos and link into powerful attacks.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Defeat enemies to gain &quot;Materia&quot;.<br />\r\n*Use &quot;Materia&quot; to buy new attacks and abilities.<br />\r\n*Combo enemies until they break to increase &quot;Materia&quot; gained.<br />\r\n*Defeat bosses to get stones to use in your sword.<br />\r\n*Swap stones mid-combo to suit your needs.<br />\r\n*Release the attack button just before an attack comes out to enhance your attacks.<br />\r\n*Block attacks as they hit to Parry. Parrying negates all damage and even reflects projectiles.<br />\r\n*Feeling overwhelmed? Cancel your attacks with a well timed parry.<br />\r\n*3 Unlockable characters<br />\r\n*80 Levels<br />\r\n*4 Difficulties",
